# KilnOps: a delivery control tower for distributed biochar

> **<<disclaimer>>**

**The problem.** A network of about 450 Kon-Tiki kilns, modelled on the publicly announced Agnisparsh project, has to deliver <<target_full>> tCO₂e of removals in 2027. No public number covers the parameter that matters most, kiln throughput, and execution has to work across dozens of mobile sites, hundreds of villages and more than a thousand operators. KilnOps asks what has to be true for the target to hold, which levers matter, and what operations should do in Q1 2027.

